window.products.push({"id":196100,"name":"MARTHA STEWART 3 Piece Oven to Table Stoneware Bakeware, Baking Dish & Casserole Set Cobalt Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALrd4XxGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile in the kitchen and beautiful on the table, the Martha Stewart 3-piece Stoneware Baker Set is a practical addition to any home baker's collection. Made from durable stoneware craftsmanship, each baking dish bakes and browns evenly to achieve golden-brown crusts and soft, flavorful crumbs. Available red, cobalt, yellow, dusty blue, grey, and pale pink, the two-toned exterior creates a stylish statement when serving from oven to table. Treat family and friends with seasonal fruit crumbles, gooey brownies, au gratin dishes, savory casseroles, and more from the easy-to-clean, glazed interior. It also allows smooth food release to easily slice through, serve, and scrape the last few bites of any dish. This set makes a charming gift for new bakers or newlyweds to share your passion for baking, family recipes, and well wishes. When not in use, stack all three pieces to save space in your cabinet for clutter-free storage.  With its beautifully-crafted design, this stoneware baker set offers style and performance to cover all bases for any baker at any level. Inspired by Martha's love for elevated dining and entertaining, these pieces let you master her recipes and bake a bit more like Martha. Oven safe up to 450°F. Dishwasher and microwave safe.  Embrace thoughtfully designed home essentials from America’s most trusted lifestyle expert, Martha Stewart. Step into her exquisite and iconic world filled with a curation of high-quality products to prep, cook, bake, serve, and enjoy. All crafted to elevate everyday homemaking and seasonal entertaining, these kitchen and tabletop pieces blend style and performance, inspiring avid hosts and home cooks to set stylish tables, serve up delicious meals, and create spectacular memories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALrd4XxGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTHA STEWART","source_asin":"B0BTNC5PQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTNC5PQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTNC5PQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
