window.products.push({"id":196104,"name":"COTTONNEST 100% Cotton Queen Sheet Set 4 Piece - Long-Staple Combed Pure Cotton - Luxury Hotel Soft Cozy Bed Sheets (Navy Blue, Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PLpEG1prL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% LONG-STAPLE COTTON】Raise your sheets with super soft, 400 thread count cotton satin sheets, woven with a rich, lustrous finish. These sheets is made of long-staple cotton and gorgeous sateen weave will offer unbelievably softness and breathability to keep you from waking up heated, sweaty, or uncomfortable. The high-quality material is more resistant to pilling and shrinking than others. You will easily enjoy the quality of a high-end hotel bed and fall asleep in pleasure every night 【ULTRA-SOFT & BREATHABLE】Featuring a rich, buttery-smooth weave, our Luxe Sateen Sheets are the ultimate bedding upgrade. Perfect for elevating your sheets, these sheets feature a luxurious 400-thread count and a slightly luminous finish. The first touch will amaze you with just the right smoothness. Another natural feature of cotton is to balance your body temperature, moisture can more easily evaporate, which gives superior comfort against your skin without extra heat and sweat 【DEEP POCKET & PRECISION FIT】Deep pocket fits mattresses up to 16 inches deep, perfect for most beds. Toss and turn as you like and say goodbye to the disturbing midnight wake. Blend of technique and elegance, and our sheets are designed to offer you a unique and sophisticated sleeping experience. The sheet sets will get softer with each wash. Queen size includes 4 piece bed sheet sets: 1 Flat Sheet 102x90 inch, 1 Fitted Sheet 80x60 inch, 2 Pillow Case 20x30 inch. 【QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP & EASY CARE】Cottonnest is a brand dedicated to helping build a cozy, comfortable haven in your bedroom and giving your family the best care from pure nature. We use high-quality cotton to ensure the softness and high precision machine to keep the seams beautiful and neat. The strict weaving process maintenance it shrinks resistant and durable. To keep its shape and quality, please machine wash it in cold water, do not use bleach, tumble dry low. 【BUY WITH CONFIDENCE】We’ve more than 40 years' experience in the design and manufacture of high-quality bedding. You can buy with confidence under our excellent product quality and customer service. If you have any inquiries or issues, please feel free to contact us, we’ll get back to you within 24hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PLpEG1prL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COTTONNEST","source_asin":"B08715Z2HL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08715Z2HL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08715Z2HL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
