window.products.push({"id":196188,"name":"JADD Rectangle Jacquard Table Cloth Classic Chevron Patten SpillProof Water Resistant Cotton Poly Fabric Tablecloth Wrinkle Proof Washable Table Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YU+zd0j2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DIVERSE CHOICES: These crafted Geometrical Design tablecloths are available in 10 vibrant colors and 7 sizes of rectangular and Square shapes. We also offer matching and pleasing napkins. This 60 x 104 inches rectanglar table cloth fits table size from 36 Inch x 78 Inch to 48 Inch x 90 Inch and Seats 8 to 10 People - Oblong/Rectangle PREMIUM QUALITY: This durable table cloth is made of premium specially treated polyester jacquard fabric to ensure the protection of your table and furniture.Seamless one-piece design is processed in a fashion that makes the table cloths wrinkle proof,anti-fading,wear resistant and durable enough.This elegant indoor/outdoor table cloth utilizes the latest most advanced technology in current table linens.All liquids,even wine will bead up so you can quickly wipe it clean with a sponge or napkin. MULTIPLE APPLICATION AND FUNCTION: Standard size with more classic color choices,these table cloths perfect for indoor and outdoor use, patio, picnic, gardens, kitchen room, dining room,cafes,catering, weddings, brunches, buffets, parties,Christmas holidays and more special occasions.It exudes cleanliness and elegance while being extremely practical. ELEGANT DESIGN: Our Deliate Jacquard table cloth Features with beautiful and contemporary pattern,professionally hemmed edges and a seamless construction that looks both elegant and enhances its durability thus can hold up beautifully even after frequent laundering. Decorate your table with our exquisite table cloth,tableware, flowers, candles or seasonal centerpiece, which will provide you with a more elegant dining environment and a more enjoyable mood for your family and guests. EASY TO CARE:Gentle machine washes cold.Do not soak or bleach. Lien dry in shade. Cool iron on reverse if required, or you can choose to embrace its natural texture for a softer, more casual look.Every order comes with a No-Hassle,30-Day Money Back Guarantee.Any problems with the size selection and the quality, please don't hesitate to contact us.Boovet are always here for helping service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YU+zd0j2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JADD","source_asin":"B088ZV32NC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088ZV32NC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088ZV32NC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
