window.products.push({"id":196277,"name":"A2Z Rug Modern Contemporary Gray Palma 9958 Area Rugs 3'9\"x5'6\" ft Modern Living Room Dinning Room and Bedroom Flooring Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911bfbdN5WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"More Information: This modern and Retro Collection area rug stablishes the 21st century style with contemporary patterns and rich designs is a great choice to any room furnishings with a lasting decorative presence. This power-loomed rug displays strokes of light and dark colours is a fine art for hardwood floors and modern home interior and decor.. Thickness: 6MM. Brand: A2Z RUG. Material: Polypropylene. Country of Manufacturing: Turkey. Suitable for: All Rooms Area rugs make your home feel more like home. Our designs come from many different countries giving them a distinct and unique character. Our range of Modern and Traditional rugs is ideal for brightening up your living room or bedroom with our rugs giving your feet extra insulation from cold floors. But there are actually many reasons why adding a rug to your home may be a good idea, and so it's important to keep all of them in mind to give you ideas as you furnish your place. A beautiful rug can transform a space by adding color, texture and style. Draughty wooden floors benefit from the beauty of a rug, whether contemporary or traditional in style, not only by creating warmth underfoot but also by enhancing the room with a vibrant color or a striking pattern. Product Care: . Vacuum rugs regularly to remove dirt and excess fiber -Use a suction type vacuum cleaner with a rotating brush attachment to prevent damage. If loose strands occur, trim with scissors, do not pull. We recommend use of a rug grip on all floor surface Blot wet spills with an absorbent tissue, do not rub Clean with mild carpet shampoo or consult a professional carpet cleaner for a deep clean. Avoid direct sunshine as it may cause","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911bfbdN5WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A2Z Rug","source_asin":"B07QP1QDT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QP1QDT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QP1QDT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
