window.products.push({"id":196323,"name":"Dooke Coasters for Drinks, Round Absorbent Ceramic Stone Coasters Set of 6 with Cork Base, Funny Drink Coasters with Holder for Cold Drinks Wine Mugs ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAXIOGFCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCELLENT QUALITY : Our ceramic coasters uses absorbent ceramic on the surface and soft cork at the bottom. Mini size convenient for taking out or storage, take no places. Each measures 4 inches diameter and comes with 6 pcs coasters and 1 iron holder.Perfect gift choices for your family or friends. FITS ALL DRINKWARE : Our 4-inch diameter drink coaster can hold cocktail glass, beer glass, goblet, coffee cup, plastic cup, silicone cup and some small cutlery, almost all types of cups. No matter which cup it matches with, it is very beautiful and coordinated. DURABLE IRON HOLDER : Each set equiped a well-designed iron holder for organizing or storaging drinks coasters, it is stain-resistant, scratch proof and won't get rusty. You can directly put the drink coasters into the holder when you don’t use them, which will make your home tidier. PREMIUM ANTI-SLIP CORK BOTTOM : Applies softer but anti skid cork back at the bottom, which can effectively isolate the heat and cold, and absorb water so that your desktop will not be polluted, protect your furnitures or tabletops from from dirty, spills, water ring and scratches, especially for wooden table. CLASSICAL DECORATION : The cute coasters set with classic round pie-shaped, frosted edge design is a perfect decoration for all kinds occasions like coffee bar, living room, farmhouse, rustic kitchen, cool room, apartment decor. Front of the coaster adopts a simulation printing process, which has a slight stone touch, great as house warming presents for new home, coffee accessories, table decor, lake house decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAXIOGFCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOOKE","source_asin":"B08P3L7C2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P3L7C2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P3L7C2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
