window.products.push({"id":196348,"name":"COOK WITH COLOR Round Food Storage Containers with Lids, Easy-Find Nesting Plastic Containers, 14 Piece Set (Pink Ombre)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DH6QeEhkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR MEALS FRESH – These colorful food containers will easily store your leftovers or meal preparations and keep them tasting great. SET INCLUDES – This package includes 7 round plastic containers with 7 coordinating sized lids in bright colors. The food storage containers are dishwasher safe for an easy clean after use. They are durable to withstand everyday use and cleaning. The set includes a range of container sizes- 4900 ml, 3200 ml, 1870 ml, 1200 ml, 680 ml, 380 ml, and 220 ml. EASY STORAGE AND ORGANIZATION – Declutter your cabinets with this set of easy-find nesting containers. When not in use, they stack inside each other including the lids. When you need a container, it will be easy to grab one and the matching lid. FOOD-SAFE AND ECO-FRIENDLY- These plastic containers are reusable, helping to eliminate the daily waste of plastic bags and other one-time use containers. They are made of safe plastic. They can be stored in a freezer and are microwave safe. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - At Cook with Color, our #1 goal is customer satisfaction, please feel free to reach out to us with any issues or comments so we can ensure that your Social Clean order experience is positive and hassle free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DH6QeEhkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOK WITH COLOR","source_asin":"B09826NCSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09826NCSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09826NCSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
