window.products.push({"id":196612,"name":"MCO Bedding Queen Bed Sheets Set - Bamboo Sheets - Cooling Breathable Bedding Set with 16\" Deep Pocket (4 Pieces, Queen, Charcoal Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KTKdHA7EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOLING & BREATHABLE - Our premium bamboo bedding is lightweight and breathable. Bamboo's ability to regulate temperature and drain away moisture makes it simple for air to pass through your bed. While you sleep, the bamboo sheet will absorb moisture. provides you with a cool and refreshing sleeping experience. BAMBOO BED SHEETS - Our bamboo sheets are made up of 40% bamboo and 60% microfiber. Bamboo sheets are silky soft, smooth and pleasant, you can instantly sweep away your exhaustion and revive yourself. DEEP POCKET DESIGN & ALL-AROUND ELASTIC - The deep pocket fitted sheet is ideal for any mattress type and is designed to fit mattresses up to 16 inches thick. The fitted sheet with all-around elastic will work well for a memory foam or traditional mattress and allows for stability. Make sure you have a comfortable and restful night's sleep. EXQUISITE EMBROIDERY - MCO bed sheet is a combination of artistic design and comfortable experience for a sweet dream. There are beautifully crafted with hand-guided embroidery pattern on each pillowcase. EASY CARE & HIGHLY DURABLE - The bamboo sheets are easy to care than traditional cotton sheets. The bed sheets are fade, pill, wrinkle, tear and shrink resistant. They are machine washable with cold water and tumble dry low. COMPLETE BEDDING SET - The Queen sheet set comes with 4 pieces. It includes 1 x flat sheet (90\"x102\"), 1 x fitted sheet(60\"x80\") and 2 matching pillowcases (20\"x30\"). The Charcoal Gray bed sheet set will add an elegant touch to your room. SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE - We promise to provide 30 nights, risk-free satisfaction guarantee. If you have concerns about the bed sheets, please feel free to let us know. We will give you the most satisfactory reply as soon as possible. Add to cart & enjoy the comfort of MCO sheets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KTKdHA7EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCO","source_asin":"B0B5TXKVH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5TXKVH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5TXKVH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
