window.products.push({"id":196912,"name":"HYOOLA Scented Votive Candles - Winter Orange Votive Candles -12 Hour Burn Time - 9 Pack - European Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cCsX5LUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hyoola European Bulk Scented Candles are the perfect addition to any occasion, creating a warm and inviting ambiance that lights up any environment. About This Product: - High Grade Highly Scented Paraffin Wax - Lead-free 100% Cotton Wick, non-toxic - Made In Europe by A Brand You Can Trust  - WInter Orange Scented Candles- Orange Votive Candles Scented - Elegant Looking- Indoor / Outdoor Use - 12 Hour Burn Time - 9-Pack - 1.4 inches by 1.4 inches (35mm x 35mm) Great For: - Bathtub - Bedroom - Romantic Dinner - Weddings - Holiday - Parties - Spa's - Event planners - Restaurants - Aromatherapy - Stress Relief Enjoy a soft, warm, soothing glow from beautifully elegant scented candles set with Hyoola Candle’s stunning votive candle! Light up your world with our amazing decorative candles votive that will beautify any room or event. Invest in the best! Hyoola small scented candles are made from natural paraffin wax to ensure premium quality. The clean and classic design won't compete with your decor and the compact size won't take up a lot of room. The warm and relaxing light of these small votive candles will create a charming, relaxing atmosphere that elevates the mood in any room Elegant Presentation, Gifts, and Party Favors Our scented votives candles are beautifully designed so they can provide the best visual aesthetic for any situation. They are perfect party favors at a wedding or celebration and a great gift idea for holidays, and housewarmings! Ignite your creativity with Hyoola Candles ! Great quality materials mixed with incredible utility will brighten up your days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cCsX5LUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B08XVW7T4N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVW7T4N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVW7T4N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":196913,"name":"Comic Book Hero One Piece Premium Ceramic Tile Coaster 4.25\"x4.25\" Square Drink Protection for Coffee Tables by Compass Litho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CTsuEzSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A fun printed item designed and sold by Compass Litho","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CTsuEzSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Compass Litho","source_asin":"B01DOKQ880","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DOKQ880","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DOKQ880","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":196914,"name":"Traditional Aluminum Portuguese Good Luck Rooster Galo de Barcelos (Black, 5.5\" Tall) - Made in Portugal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pdMqZz7mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"As the story goes, back in the middle ages the people of Barcelos were deeply concerned about an unsolved crime. When a stranger from Galicia arrived in town, claiming to be en route to Santiago de Compostela in Spain, the finger of blame was pointed at him. He, of course, protested his innocence but he was sentenced to death by hanging. In a bid to avoid this fate, he begged to see the judge who had passed the sentence. The judge happened to be eating dinner with some friends when the Galician arrived. The condemned man pointed to a roasted cockerel on the dinner table and declared that “It is as certain that I am innocent as it is certain that this rooster will crow when they hang me.” Needless to say, he was laughed out of the room and dragged off to his fate. The official and his friends decided against eating the bird but they were still taken aback when the cockerel actually stood up and crowed, proving the man’s innocence. Realizing his mistake, the judge rushed to the gallows to try and prevent the innocent man from being hanged. By the time he arrived, however, the Galician was dangling from a rope. Luckily, the knot had been badly tied, saving the man’s life. The judge ordered him to be cut down immediately and freed. O Galo de Barcelos is the unofficial symbol of Portugal. In any curio or tourist shop you will find the symbol represented by a ceramic rooster and in the motif embroidered in towels, aprons, stamped on key chains, paper weights, etc. Because of its lively colors, the Rooster of Barcelos is difficult to miss where ever it appears. The motif seems to embody the love of life displayed by the Portuguese people. The symbol has its genesis in the history of Barcelos. The city of Barcelos is located just east of Braga. Even though it is not on a major highway, it still is a good sized city. The legend of the Rooster is so old that no one knows for sure its real source.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pdMqZz7mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ibergift","source_asin":"B098LWKX26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098LWKX26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098LWKX26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
