window.products.push({"id":196968,"name":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc. 300 Thread-Count, 22 Inch, Extra-Deep Pocket, Long Staple, Single-Ply, Pre-Shrunk Cotton Sateen, 4 Piece Sheet Set, Calif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1yqvQhJYoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Imported 4-Piece Extra Deep Pocket Sheet in California King size includes 1 Extra-Deep Pocket fully elasticized Fitted Sheet (72 in x 84in x 22 in Deep), 1 King Flat Sheet (112\" x 102\") and Two King Pillowcases (20\" x 40\"). Our fitted sheets are 22 inches deep in depth. This means they can easily fit your deep mattresses without coming off. The all-around elastic on our fitted sheets will cover your deep luxurious mattress and any toppers easily, no matter how much you toss and turn. Looking to update your bedroom with a Quality Product without Spending a lot of money? Our collection of 300 Thread-count bedsheet Sets fit the bill. These sheet sets are extra-deep pockets and made with our highest quality 300 Thread-Count cotton fabric in sateen weave. They are breathable, Light weight and extremely soft. We only use the finest long staple, single-ply yarns to make the fabric used in our sheet set. This is a high-end product and has smooth and lustrous finish. The 300 cotton Thread-count sheet sets are true Extra-Deep Pocket Sheet sets that easily fits mattresses up to 21 inches deep without slipping off. Our Sheets are smooth and soft, breathable, Light weight, and made in an OKEO-TEX 100 Certified factory. We guarantee a comfortable fit on mattresses up to 22 inch deep. These will easily fit your mattresses even if you have a mattress topper or even tall air mattresses. Easy Care & Fade Resistant: Our Sheet sets are Fade and Pilling Resistant. They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time. These Sheet Sets are high-quality and made with our Signature Top of the line quality 300 Thread-Count long-Staple Cotton Luxurious fabric, providing a substantially higher smoothness and softness. 30-DAY RISK-FREE GUARANTEE: Our products are high quality & we back them up with a Risk & worry-free 30-day guarantee. If you are not satisfied for any reason, you can contact us to discuss return or refund options. Plus, our 90-Day warranty against any defects gives you one less thing to worry about. When you purchase a Southshore product, you are not just purchasing an exceptional quality home textile product, you are getting an absolute commitment on unmatched customer service as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1yqvQhJYoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B07YW4TSDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YW4TSDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YW4TSDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
