window.products.push({"id":196972,"name":"SONGMICS Underwear Drawer Organizer, Collapsible Closet Dividers for Bras, Underwear, Socks, Ties and Scarves, Foldable Storage Box, Set of 4, Light G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MkxGruWEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TIME-SAVING STORAGE: With this underwear organizer, you will not be bothered to fish through messy drawers or wardrobes for specific panty or bra while in a rush to get ready VARIED ORGANISATION: 4-piece storage space meets different organisation needs, we carry 5 cell (12.6\"L x 12.6\"W x 3.9\"H) for bras, 6 cell (12.6\"L x 6.3\"W x 3.9\"H) for scarves or pants, 8 cell (12.6\"L x 6.3\"W x 3.9\"H) for ties and 24 cell (12.6\"L x 12.6\"W x 3.9\"H) for socks or other accessories MADE TO LAST: Made of updated non-woven fabric with firm stitching, this set lets you say goodbye to shoddy underwear organizers; your delicate bra and panties deserve a better home APPLAUD FOR ITS CONVENIENCE: Boasting a bottom zipper and removable side panels, these drawer organizers are ready to be tucked away when not in use WHAT YOU GET: 4 storage boxes in different sizes, a fodable design, and a simple way to bring order to your drawers. Bring these drawer organizers to keep various odds and ends in style!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MkxGruWEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SONGMICS","source_asin":"B0833TKRXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0833TKRXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0833TKRXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":196973,"name":"Stiio Bath Mat Rug-17\" X29\", Stone Bath Mats Non-Slip Super Absorbent Dries Quickly Bathroom Rugs Easy Care, Thin Bath Rugs Stone Fit Under Door Floor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dPUVGkSZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-slip At All: Stiio floor mats are engineered with anti-skid rubber backing that offer better grips on both dry and wet floors, preventing shifts, slips, or curls. Place these bath rugs in the bath, kitchen, living room, front of the sink to create a safety net for elders and children. Quick Dry With Instant Absorption: Featuring newest nano technology and up to 90% porosity, this diatomaceous earth bath rug permeates water within seconds, and dries off within a couple of minutes. It keeps your floor crispy dry and home utmost clean. Upgrade Triple Layer Bathroom Mats: Stiio Innovative bathroom mat rugs provide the softest support for your feet, with a comfortable faux plush finish against cold floors. The high-quality diatom mud foam interlayer absorbs moisture instantly. Double anti-slip effect on the bottom and top of the bath mat. Essential for dry floors in indoor and outdoor bathrooms, kitchens, living rooms, dens, halls, bedrooms, porches, balconies, sinks, bathrooms. Wear & Stain-resistant: This ultrathin 5mm bathroom mat fits under any doors without causing any tripping hazard, it contains no microfiber so it won't shed, come loose, tear up, or hide out stains or dirts, great for long-term use. Available in S (15.5 x 23.5 inch) for over counter, sink front, table, pet feeding use; M (17.5 x 29.5 inch) for laundry, bathroom, bedroom, living room, garage use. Rinse Easy: Rinse with warm water to get rid of stains or give it a thorough clean with a brush. Let it air out for a night then it will be fresh as new. No machine wash needed! We endeavor to offer the best quality floor mats and if you have any issues, please contact our customer care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dPUVGkSZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stiio","source_asin":"B09TB22NNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-196973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TB22NNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TB22NNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
